\fs20 \cf0 The infomation downloaded from Gracenote CDDB for compilation CD's sometimes lists in the correct Artist infomation as part of the Song Name and places the DJ or Composer in the Artist field\
\
This script will seperate the Artist/Composer name from the Song Name when this situation arises and places the infomation in the correct fields as required.\
\
Select the tracks in question and run the script, you will be presented with a number of options to describe the current format of the infomation in the Song Name field, select the description which matches the format of the infomation..\
\
Note: To make use of the Composer options you must be running itunes version 3 or higher, this field is not available in version 2.\
\
If you have selected a format that contains the Artist option and you are running version 3 of itunes  then you will be given an option to save the tracks current Artist infomation in the Composer field. This is handy for when working on mix cd's since the DJ who made the mix is usually listed as the Artist..   \
\
Are making your choices the relevant infomation is moved to the correct fields\
\
Place the script in your itunes script folder \
\
